@SupportApi = http://localhost:5000
@RequesterId = aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa
@TicketId = replace-with-created-ticket-id

### Health
GET {{SupportApi}}/

### List tickets
GET {{SupportApi}}/tickets?page=1&pageSize=20

### Create ticket
POST {{SupportApi}}/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requesterId": "{{RequesterId}}",
  "requesterName": "Nguyễn Thị Quế",
  "subject": "Không đăng nhập được",
  "description": "Mã xác thực bị từ chối khi tôi đăng nhập.",
  "priority": "High"
}

### Read ticket
GET {{SupportApi}}/tickets/{{TicketId}}

### Filter tickets
GET {{SupportApi}}/tickets?status=New&priority=High&q=đăng&page=1&pageSize=10

### Tickets by requester
GET {{SupportApi}}/users/{{RequesterId}}/tickets

### Read ticket history
GET {{SupportApi}}/tickets/{{TicketId}}/history

### Change status; use the current ticket version
PATCH {{SupportApi}}/tickets/{{TicketId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Assigned",
  "expectedVersion": 1,
  "reason": "Đã tiếp nhận xử lý."
}

### Not found example
GET {{SupportApi}}/tickets/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
